  Message:
    WHOSE reads the first word of each line as a FIELD of the cast — but this
    EVERY has no cast to take the fields from: it binds `t` over every
    member of the roll, whatever shape each one has.

    Name the cast:

      EVERY Tenant t IN tenants WHOSE arrears AT LEAST 1000

    or write the filter with WHO, where the member is named:

      EVERY t IN tenants WHO t's arrears AT LEAST 1000
